-| | mean | p95 | budget |
-|---|---|---|---|
-| full command, all steps | **175.5 ms** | 405.4 ms | **1.75x** |
-| full command, no refresh due | 149.7 ms | 161.9 ms | 1.50x |
-| full command, refresh step | 407.4 ms | 424.6 ms | 4.07x |
-| of which QP solve | 51.4 ms | 54.5 ms | 0.51x |
